{"id":"d25297b7-5bfa-5283-ae6a-da5f8e524904","title":"页面文件格式","icon":"📄","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-08T19:30:38.316Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:06.310Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"页面文件格式","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"artifact 格式版本 3","title":"一份页面在磁盘上长什么样","lead":"每个页面都是一份 JSON：外层信封、可嵌套的 Page/Board 容器、编辑器区块和组件引用。直接生成或修改页面源文件时以此为准。","facts":[{"label":"当前版本","value":"3"},{"label":"页面结构上限","value":"16 MiB"},{"label":"节点上限","value":"12,000"},{"label":"嵌套深度","value":"48 层"}],"art":"concepts"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-de4ba1e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-ee4bbb1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"文件长什么样"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"展开左侧的结构树，点选字段查看含义和示例。新建页面默认是一个 Page 根容器。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-be4b6f8"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-tree","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"name":"page.showai.json","kind":"object","type":"信封","open":true,"summary":"一个页面就是一个 JSON 文件，最外层是信封。","detail":"`format` 固定为 `showai`，`version` 为 3。版本 1（普通文档）和 2（旧白板）仍可读取，存储的资源不会被降级。","example":"{\n  \"format\": \"showai\",\n  \"version\": 3,\n  \"document\": {\"id\": \"research\", \"title\": \"研究\", \"content\": \"…\"}\n}","exampleLang":"json","children":[{"name":"format","kind":"field","type":"\"showai\"","badge":"必填","summary":"格式标识。"},{"name":"version","kind":"field","type":"1 | 2 | 3","badge":"必填","summary":"新资源一律为 3。","detail":"旧版本在首次受控保存时升级，原始字节保存为 `migrations/<资源 id>/original-v1.json` 或 `original-v2.json`。"},{"name":"document","kind":"object","type":"页面","badge":"必填","open":true,"summary":"页面的元数据、内容树、外框和视图。","children":[{"name":"id","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"资源 ID，标识这个文件。","detail":"与根容器的 `attrs.id` 不同：资源 ID 标识文件，根容器 ID 标识内容节点。"},{"name":"title · icon · cover","kind":"field","type":"string","summary":"标题、图标与封面。","detail":"图标可以是文字或 Emoji、HTTP(S) 图片地址，或内嵌的位图数据。"},{"name":"parentId","kind":"field","type":"string | null","summary":"所属的**项目文件夹**。","detail":"这是资源在侧栏中的位置；区块操作里的 `parentId` 指的是内容容器，两者不同。"},{"name":"favorite · archived","kind":"field","type":"boolean","summary":"收藏与归档（删除即归档隐藏）。"},{"name":"createdAt · updatedAt","kind":"field","type":"ISO 时间","summary":"创建与更新时间。"},{"name":"content","kind":"object","type":"surface","badge":"内容树","open":true,"summary":"根容器：一个 `kind` 为 `page` 或 `board` 的 `surface` 节点。","detail":"容器可以递归嵌套；嵌套的容器必须位于 surface 或 region 之下。所有非文本节点都有**唯一且稳定**的 `attrs.id`。根 Page 可设 `attrs.widthMode`：`standard`、`wide` 或 `full`。","example":"{\n  \"type\": \"surface\",\n  \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"page-root\", \"kind\": \"page\", \"name\": \"Page\"},\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"surface\",\n      \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"board\", \"kind\": \"board\", \"name\": \"分析\"},\n      \"content\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}","exampleLang":"json","children":[{"name":"richText","kind":"object","type":"节点","summary":"普通编辑器区块的容器：段落、标题、列表、表格等。"},{"name":"region","kind":"object","type":"节点","summary":"布局分组，模式为 flow、grid 或 free。","detail":"专属字段是 mode、columns 和 gap。region 不会创建新的视口；free 模式的子项使用本地坐标。"},{"name":"surface","kind":"object","type":"节点","summary":"嵌入的 Page 或 Board 模块。"},{"name":"widget","kind":"object","type":"节点","summary":"组件区块：`attrs.kind` + `attrs.data`。","example":"{\n  \"type\": \"widget\",\n  \"attrs\": {\n    \"id\": \"metrics-1\",\n    \"kind\": \"metrics\",\n    \"data\": {\n      \"title\": \"结果\",\n      \"items\": [{\"label\": \"样本\", \"value\": 120}]\n    }\n  }\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"drawing","kind":"object","type":"节点","summary":"Board 中的笔迹与形状，没有子节点。"}]},{"name":"layout","kind":"object","type":"{ [nodeId]: 外框 }","summary":"父级拥有的外框。","detail":"`x`、`y`、`width`，可选 `height` 与 `heightMode`（`fixed` 或 `auto`）。`auto` 只用于 Page 模块，Board 模块保持有界视口。Board 与 free 分组的子项使用本地坐标，Page 与 flow/grid 子项按树顺序排列。","example":"{\n  \"board\": {\n    \"x\": 0,\n    \"y\": 0,\n    \"width\": 800,\n    \"height\": 460,\n    \"heightMode\": \"fixed\"\n  }\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"surfaceViews","kind":"object","type":"{ [surfaceId]: 视图 }","summary":"每层容器的命名视图与阅读顺序。","detail":"`initial` 为视图 id 或 null，`saved` 是 `{id, name, targets}` 列表，`readingOrder` 是子节点 id 列表。当前滚动、相机和选择是个人状态，不写入文件。","example":"{\n  \"page-root\": {\"initial\": null, \"saved\": [], \"readingOrder\": [\"board\"]}\n}","exampleLang":"json"},{"name":"comments","kind":"array","type":"评论[]","summary":"`{id, text, createdAt, resolved}`。"},{"name":"templateContext","kind":"object","type":"可选","summary":"应用模板时记录的精确工作流引用。","detail":"包含 `format`、`system` 与 `templates`。它记录工作流，不授予访问其他项目的权限。"}]},{"name":"presentation","kind":"field","type":"\"spatial\" | \"reading\"","badge":"可选","summary":"呈现方式，默认 `spatial`。","detail":"Page 在两种方式下都保持正常排版；`reading` 会把根 Board 投影成阅读顺序。"},{"name":"selection","kind":"object","type":"{ blockIds }","badge":"可选","summary":"表示这是页面的**局部投影**，保留必要的祖先容器。","detail":"局部导出附带的 `.showai.json` 不能用来覆盖完整页面。"},{"name":"components","kind":"array","type":"已编译组件[]","badge":"导出生成","summary":"导出文件中去重后的组件运行包。","detail":"每项包含清单字段、`schema`、`html` 沙箱运行代码、`integrity`，以及可选的 `inline` 挂载代码。这些是编译输出，不应手写。"},{"name":"remoteComponents","kind":"array","type":"发布定位[]","badge":"导出生成","summary":"需要联网的导出使用的已验证组件网址。","detail":"包含 `ref`、`bundleRef`、`url`、`sha256`、`bytes`、`manifestUrl` 等。只使用发布校验返回的定位，不要自行编写。"}]}],"initial":"page.showai.json/document/content","caption":"字段来自 src/types.ts 与 src/surface/validation.mjs。"},"integrity":"sha256-74d9519ab11b450f4d2feec3813ad0e0d8a26b3d1c93510a74c9a765e1578215"},"id":"node-ce4b88b"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"💡","tone":"blue","id":"node-11e4c06a"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用 Agent 修改页面时，优先使用区块操作（"},{"type":"text","text":"page_apply","marks":[{"type